A step of ledger.sql with no `;` after it: roux-db splits the ledger where
SQLite says each statement ends, and refuses one that does not. Nothing
runs.

== before
CREATE TABLE dish (id INTEGER PRIMARY KEY, title TEXT NOT NULL) STRICT;
INSERT INTO dish VALUES (1, 'soup');

== after
CREATE TABLE dish (id INTEGER PRIMARY KEY, name TEXT NOT NULL) STRICT;

== ledger
ALTER TABLE dish RENAME COLUMN title TO name

== error
roux-db: a step with no `;` after it: each step of ledger.sql is one statement, ended by `;`
